BCC                     alias to bayesCC(...)
BRCAData                Data from TCGA BRCA paper, as used in Lock &
                        Dunson, Bioinformatics 2013.
alignClusters           Align cluster label vectors or cluster label
                        matrices as needed
alignMatrices           Align matrices of cluster labels.
alignVectors            Align vectors of cluster labels.
alphaStar               compute mean adjusted adherence, the
                        recommended figure of merit for bayesCC
bayesCC                 Bayesian Consensus Clustering
earlyReduction          do dimension reduction (via NMF or SVD) before
                        Bayesian consensus clustering
jointNMF                attempt a joint nonnegative matrix
                        factorization of two matrices, as described in
                        Wang et al. 2014,
                        doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btu679
logSum                  convenience function
